  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">REF 2016 consultancy for docs &amp; manuals</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">REF 2016 konsultuppdrag dokument&amp;manual</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In December 2015 Sida signed an agreement with Tanzania on rural electrification. The agreement is based on a programme proposal from Tanzania&apos;s Rural Energy Agency (REA). A large part of the programme involves support to private developers for rural electrification through a per-Connection subsidy. The subsidy is given after a successful application and establishing of a contract, awarded through competetive bidding. The purpose of this contribution is to procure support from a consultant to finalise an operational manual for how the programme is supposed to be implemented and to finalise the documents necessary to be inplace for the call for proposals procedure.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida ingick december 2015 avtal med Tanzania om landsbygdselektrifiering. Avtalet baserades p&#xe5; ett projektf&#xf6;rslag fr&#xe5;n Tanzanias Rural Energy Agency (REA). En stor del av projektet inneb&#xe4;r st&#xf6;d till privata organisationer f&#xf6;r implementering av energiprojekt medelst ett incitament/subvention per ansluten kund. St&#xf6;det ges efter ans&#xf6;kan och tilldelning av kontrakt och dessa kontrakt tilldelas i konkurrens. Avsikten med insatsen &#xe4;r att upphandla konsulttj&#xe4;nst f&#xf6;r att f&#xe4;rdigst&#xe4;lla anv&#xe4;ndarmanual f&#xf6;r hur upphandlingen av privata genomf&#xf6;rare ska g&#xe5; till och f&#xe4;rdigst&#xe4;llande av tillh&#xf6;rande ans&#xf6;kningshandlingar.</narrative>
  </description>
